orker_summary": "Closeout tick ai-plays-poke-foreman-2026-10-29-07-05-53. Worker gpt-5.6-sol@openai-codex in wt/DF-AIPP-21 landed 4f8f7c2 (MODEL_IMMEDIATE_EDGE_RECROSS_POLICY + model_edge_recross_blocked event, cron_runner.py +155, tests +127); merged as 3ec7aed (pushed, origin/main parity 0). AC met on the live arm: run_df21_accept2 60cy jev rc=0 - 1 transition Pallet Town->1F c3, 0 returns, 1F<->PT pair regressions 0 (baseline run_df17plan2 = 26); log committed as .coding-hermes/board/evidence-DF-AIPP-21-run_df21_accept2.jsonl; stdout of the mechanism run (9 live policy blocks) as evidence-DF-AIPP-21-run_df21_accept1-stdout.log. Tests: 4 new policy tests RED vs 9738912; 33 focused green; full 4548p/27s x2 venvs; ruff+mypy clean; hook Tier1 full PASS on worker commit; CI success on 3ec7aed; gitleaks no leaks on evidence. Judge 4456816d: code deliverable verified sound and green; overall FAIL is (a) tier1 secrets = INT-GL-2 scope artifact (its own output prints gitleaks no leaks found, 382MB) and (b) tier2 could not see the gitignored worktree cron_logs + row was pending at judge time - both cured here by in-repo evidence + this closeout. ch:trace row=DF-AIPP-21 spec=cron_runner.py#model-policy-recrossing wave=.coding-hermes/waves/ai-plays-poke-foreman-2026-10-29-07-05-53.json#serial test=tests/test_navigation_dead_end_route.py::test_model_recross_policy_blocks_immediate_house_reentry doc=none:code-policy prompt=/tmp/ai-plays-poke-foreman-2026-10-29-07-05-53-DF-AIPP-21-brief.txt evidence=.coding-hermes/board/evidence-DF-AIPP-21-run_df21_accept2.jsonl witness=live:cron_logs/run_df21_accept2.jsonl+github:ci-3ec7aed verdict=4456816d:code-sound-overall-fail-t1-INT-GL-2-t2-evidence-cured commit=3ec7aed4f252ca2efa0791cf579b58189ac2cce2 memory=/project/ai-plays-poke/ticks/ai-plays-poke-foreman-2026-10-29-07-05-53 STATUS: COMPLETE TIER: T3 EVIDENCE: committed evidence jsonl + stdout logs + verdict 4456816d + CI run on 3ec7aed", "depends_on": ["DF-AIPP-17"], "worktree": "/ho